            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A tool? (أداة, adāt.) To own? (ملك, malaka.) To lose? (خسر, khasira.) To keep? (حفظ, ḥafiẓa.) A talent? (موهبة, mawhiba.) To long for? (اشتاق, ishtāqa.) An expectation? (توقع, tawaqquʿ.) Enthusiasm? (حماس, ḥamās.) A wish? (أمنية, umniyya.) A preference? (تفضيل, tafḍīl.) Longing? (شوق, shawq.) Ambition? (طموح, ṭumūḥ.) A purpose? (غاية, ghāya.) A project? (مشروع, mashrūʿ.) A suggestion? (اقتراح, iqtirāḥ.) Interest? (اهتمام, ihtimām.) To hate? (كره, kariha.) A desire? (رغبة, raghba.) A dream? (حلم, ḥulm.) Hope? (أمل, amal.) A goal? (هدف, hadaf.) A plan? (خطة, khuṭṭa.) A need? (حاجة, ḥāja.) To need? (احتاج, iḥtāja.) To wish? (تمنى, tamannā.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
